05-products-by-day/
final pins/

# Source/working files we don't want public
*.md
!README.md

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
~$*

# Build artifacts
.cache/
.wrangler/
package-lock.json
package.json
